        <div class="comparison-column">
          <h3 class="comparison-title">❌ Without tfplan2md</h3>
          {{ codeWindow("Raw Terraform Output", '<pre><code>~ azuredevops_variable_group.example will be updated in-place\n~ resource "azuredevops_variable_group" "example" {\n    id   = "123"\n    name = "example-variables"\n\n  - variable {\n      # At least one attribute in this block is (or was) sensitive,\n      # so its contents will not be displayed.\n    }\n  + variable {\n      # At least one attribute in this block is (or was) sensitive,\n      # so its contents will not be displayed.\n    }\n}</code></pre>') }}
          <p class="comparison-note">Which variables changed? Which names were added or removed? The raw diff does not answer that.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="comparison-column">
          <h3 class="comparison-title">✅ With tfplan2md</h3>
          {% exampleBlock "features--azdo-variable-groups--example-1" %}
          <p class="comparison-note">Added, updated, removed, and unchanged variables are all labeled explicitly in one semantic diff.</p>
        </div>
      {% endcall %}
    {% endcall %}
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section section-alt">
