        <p class="feature-highlight-desc">Variables are matched by name across before and after states and categorized as added, modified, removed, or unchanged.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-highlight-card">
        <div class="feature-highlight-icon">📊</div>
        <h3 class="feature-highlight-title">Unified Display</h3>
